 ${misc:Depends},
# The greeter runs in kitty inside a small Wayland compositor; configs for
# sway, Hyprland (0.55+, Lua), niri and cagebreak are in /etc/greetd.
Recommends:
 sway | hyprland | niri,
Description: graphical console greeter for greetd with ASCII art and themes
 sysc-greet is a terminal-style greeter for the greetd login daemon, written
 in Go with Bubble Tea: ASCII art per session, animated backgrounds, themes
 and border styles. It runs fullscreen in kitty under a Wayland compositor.
 .
 Installing it does not change /etc/greetd/config.toml; see
 /usr/share/doc/sysc-greet/README.Debian to switch greetd over.
